+  - `src/service.py`: 100%
+  - `src/storage.py`: 100%
+  - `src/model.py`: 100%
+  - `src/cli.py`: 98%
+- **Static compilation**: `python -m compileall src tests` (0 errores, 0 advertencias)
+- **Security / repo checks**: `REPO_CONTRACT: PASS` (`python scripts/check_repo_contract.py`)
