++++- Follow AGENTS.md.
++++- Use REQUIREMENTS.md and SPEC.md as the source of truth.
++++- Preserve architecture boundaries (CLI handles parsing/formatting, Service implements filtering logic, Storage and Model contracts remain unmodified).
